Before an error was being generated for valid named multiline problem patterns like this:
```json
"problemPatterns": [
    {
        "name": "rustc",
        "patterns": [
            {
                "regexp": "^(warning|warn|error)(?:\\[(.*?)\\])?: (.*)$",
                "severity": 1,
                "code": 2,
                "message": 3
            },
            {
                "regexp": "^[\\s->=]*(.*?):(\\d*):(\\d*)\\s*$",
                "file": 1,
                "line": 2,
                "column": 3
            }
        ]
    }
],
```
And when an error was generated the pattern was ignored.

This PR fixes that.
